        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana PH35, Solid Brass Fixed Pivot Hinge Pair</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis Light Duty Brass Pivot Hinge is for doors up to 35 lbs. It comes packaged as a pair with matching finish #10 x 1\" wood screws. The Fixed Pivot Hinge for Doors Up 35 lbs is available in an array of finish options.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PH35-specifications.gif?v=1704354653\" width=\"512\" height=\"267\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana PH35 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/fixed-pivot-hinge-for-doors-up-70-lbs-deltana-ph40\"><b>Pivot Hinges for Doors Up to 70 lbs</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/heavy-duty-pivot-hinge-for-doors-up-to-200-lbs-deltana-ph60\"><b>Pivot Hinges for Doors Up to 200 lbs</b></a> \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-7/8\" Pivot Hinge:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Size: 3-7/8\" x 5/8\" x 1-7/8\" </li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 1/4\"</li> \r\n<li>Load Capacity: 35 LB. </li>\r\n<li>Packaged as a pair containing one left hand and one right hand pivot hinge.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-PH35-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262216\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana PH35 Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWe offer different <a href=\"/pages/deltana-finish-colors\" target=\"new\">finishes</a>, but no matter which finish you choose, the base metal will still be <b>High Quality Solid Brass</b>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold as a Pair (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
